quran[14]{c,v,t}:
  36,41,Another sign for them is that We carried their seed (from the progeny of Adam) into the laden Ark (of Noah and saved them).
  36,42,"And like this (Ark,) We created for them (many other things) which they ride."
  36,43,"If We wish, We can drown them, then they will have none to call for help, and they will not be rescued either,"
  36,44,"except by a mercy from Us, and for an enjoyment until some time."
  36,45,"When it is said to them: ‘Beware of what is ahead of you (in the Hereafter), and what is behind you (from the remnants of the destroyed nations), so that you may be shown mercy.’"
  36,46,"Whenever a sign came to them from among the signs of their Lord, they always turned away from it."
  36,47,"And when they are told: ‘Spend out of what Allah has provided you,’ the disbelievers say to the believers: ‘Shall we feed (someone) whom Allah would have fed if He had wanted?’ You are just in clear error."
  36,48,And they say: ‘When will this promise (of the Last Hour) be fulfilled if you are truthful?’
  36,49,But all they are waiting for is a single blast that will overtake them while they are disputing among themselves.
  36,50,"Then they will not be able to make a bequest, nor will they return to their families."
  36,51,The Trumpet will be blown (again). And behold! They will rush out to their Lord from (their) graves.
  36,52,"They will say: ‘Alas for us! Who has raised us from our place of sleep? This is what the Most-Compassionate (Lord) had promised, and the messengers spoke the truth.’"
  36,53,It will be just a single Blast. And behold! They will all be presented before Us.
  36,54,"Today, no soul shall be wronged in the least, nor shall you be rewarded except for what you used to do."
